            "target_entity_instance": "Kakdwip",
            "target_entity_type": "Country_Subdivision",
            "paragraph": "This shift is spatially polarized, with inland blocks like Minakhan achieving a dominant 5.50% CAGR and nearly 486% total growth in fish production, while coastal frontline blocks like Kakdwip and Sagar remain stagnant due to chronic climate stressors and soil salinization.",
